IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BALSUM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY ACCTREC.
       COPY SUMREC.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC S9(13)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-RC PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-RC.
       MAIN.
           ADD ACCT-BALANCE TO WS-TOTAL
           MOVE WS-TOTAL TO SUM-TOTAL-BALANCE
           MOVE 0 TO LK-RC
           GOBACK.
